{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1195803,\"title\":\"Wicker\",\"tagline\":\"Marriage material.\",\"overview\":\"On the outskirts of a village by the sea, lives a Fisherwoman; smelly, single and perpetually ridiculed. One day, fed up with her stuffy, small-minded neighbours, she commissions herself a husband to be made from wicker. In an otherwise conservative town, this unconventional romance sparks outrage, jealousy and chaos.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6FcBZOKvyrLCKGCyBG0ySCR4okt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xVh1ypMoVkMf5IB7y3hnRplJ14c.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"voteCount\":58,\"year\":2026,\"runtime\":105,\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Fantasy\",\"Comedy\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"GB\",\"name\":\"United Kingdom\"},{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":10000000,\"revenue\":36713709,\"director\":\"Eleanor Wilson\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":566414,\"name\":\"Eleanor Wilson\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ittuuCohcMGIPsvGgL7yld0thv6.jpg\"},{\"id\":1786006,\"name\":\"Alex Huston Fischer\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ytmBqnXJIVYEn4EdpEjFmTM6Y7b.jpg\"},{\"id\":39187,\"name\":\"Olivia Colman\",\"character\":\"The Fisherwoman\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lawJUdbLb1YW0niaYjiVGR9IBG8.jpg\"},{\"id\":28846,\"name\":\"Alexander Skarsgård\",\"character\":\"The Wicker Husband\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6VNNddrSrIVgdzhXr4Zg89gmOzY.jpg\"},{\"id\":22970,\"name\":\"Peter Dinklage\",\"character\":\"The Basketmaker\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9CAd7wr8QZyIN0E7nm8v1B6WkGn.jpg\"},{\"id\":1133349,\"name\":\"Elizabeth Debicki\",\"character\":\"The Tailor’s Wife\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sJxj44aKdY0pjSIgnxBgMWLrQmw.jpg\"},{\"id\":2057222,\"name\":\"Marli Siu\",\"character\":\"The Bottlewasher’s Wife\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pNi3TfnnJuDz25m93Nr2AKIYV4R.jpg\"},{\"id\":2152343,\"name\":\"Nabhaan Rizwan\",\"character\":\"The Tailor\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ljDpNmRnx9Mxe6DZbOMVZlGVXAN.jpg\"},{\"id\":20766,\"name\":\"Richard E. Grant\",\"character\":\"The Doctor\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/92oaBntIXhndCxUXaGywUyILIIE.jpg\"},{\"id\":65301,\"name\":\"Phil Daniels\",\"character\":\"The Butcher\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6yNFNjo3cWEcuAUrl0CNQnAnQ5M.jpg\"},{\"id\":1786304,\"name\":\"Kiell Smith-Bynoe\",\"character\":\"The Innkeeper\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6pVa2SEgMfR2u7E3xfIUGZSqinh.jpg\"},{\"id\":1870466,\"name\":\"Emily Lloyd-Saini\",\"character\":\"The Innkeeper’s Wife\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tW4TD9PmBGutKVhvUNXSWxZjkVn.jpg\"},{\"id\":3250136,\"name\":\"Ella Bruccoleri\",\"character\":\"The Bakerwoman\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xVqbUOELKqxhEdqAz5IXhFYp7Uy.jpg\"},{\"id\":1428295,\"name\":\"Gustav Lindh\",\"character\":\"The Bottlewasher\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qbCsiIl0C0E1vYvLXqK2T98bvyO.jpg\"},{\"id\":2141561,\"name\":\"Ben Ashenden\",\"character\":\"The Bakerman\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qwE3vNi5PDIQIOeTcYzR0iVWj8g.jpg\"},{\"id\":1365662,\"name\":\"Scott Alexander Young\",\"character\":\"The Shoemaker\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dBROs1QHWtte2pPq6rY3opMUOZg.jpg\"},{\"id\":62230,\"name\":\"Shobu Kapoor\",\"character\":\"The Shoemaker’s Wife\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xYw04alDmANRMeSw9Xi7wt5HQwm.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1302904,\"title\":\"Practical Magic 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ogwQOLbCfncjvBhFb5l0OmQH8KC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oIglj0Jy9duG4LnrRUpH8n001Pk.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Owens sisters must confront the dark curse that threatens to unravel their family once and for all.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Fantasy\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":809,\"title\":\"Shrek 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2yYP0PQjG8zVqturh1BAqu2Tixl.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b33E34IywGC4NWYY3G1ck7uehNF.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Happily ever after never seemed so far far away when a trip to meet the in-laws turns into a hilariously twisted adventure for Shrek and Fiona. With the help of ever-faithful Donkey, Shrek takes on the potion-brewing Fairy Godmother, pompous Prince Charming, and infamous ogre-killer Puss In Boots.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4523,\"title\":\"Enchanted\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8KCNzCArLlvLdQoHx6npua2VSVc.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u4UpRDi0w84aNrigr9p049rMHiy.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The beautiful princess Giselle is banished by an evil queen from her magical, musical animated land and finds herself in the gritty reality of the streets of modern-day Manhattan. Shocked by this strange new environment that doesn't operate on a \\\"happily ever after\\\" basis, Giselle is now adrift in a chaotic world badly in need of enchantment. But when Giselle begins to fall in love with a charmingly flawed divorce lawyer who has come to her aid - even though she is already promised to a perfect fairy tale prince back home - she has to wonder: Can a storybook view of romance survive in the real world?\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":12797,\"title\":\"Ghost Town\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/b8VS14DwpLlugTxVWSllYU0Gjn5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iDgK5UFgXKVqegWYc5tl58qfGOw.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Bertram Pincus, a cranky, people-hating Manhattan dentist, develops the unwelcome ability to see dead people. Really annoying dead people. Even worse, they all want something from him, particularly Frank Herlihy, a smooth-talking ghost, who pesters him into a romantic scheme involving his widow Gwen. They are soon entangled in a hilarious predicament between the now and the hereafter!\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10096,\"title\":\"13 Going on 30\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iNZdSIfhSCMtRILDNyhLn8UKeSG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ld7UTOGzZSxIMbuYsb6eQ6QdN4h.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After total humiliation at her thirteenth birthday party, Jenna Rink wants to just hide until she's thirty. Thanks to some magic wishing dust, Jenna's prayer has been answered. With a knockout body, a fabulous wardrobe, an athlete boyfriend, a dream job, and superstar friends, this can't be a better life. But soon Jenna realizes that adult life isn’t as easy as she hoped for.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9889,\"title\":\"Shallow Hal\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q4lZrHWTWuybb6pzMucj1c0ngCW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7QkEgz9pEnS9AYzQmu465LMSwh0.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After taking his dying father's advice, Hal dates only the embodiments of female physical perfection. But that all changes after Hal has an unexpected run-in with self-help guru Tony Robbins. Intrigued by Hal's shallowness, Robbins hypnotizes him into seeing the beauty that exists even in the least physically appealing women. Hal soon falls for Rosemary, but he doesn't realize that his gorgeous girlfriend is actually a 300-pound-not-so-hottie.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":59436,\"title\":\"Midnight in Paris\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4wBG5kbfagTQclETblPRRGihk0I.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b5bcKhvN6VP82U5ztNdPfOLiolD.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"While on a trip to Paris with his fiancée's family, a nostalgic screenwriter finds himself mysteriously going back to the 1920s every day at midnight.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Comedy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5994,\"title\":\"The Family Man\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9wToOVsKuf0XeKhlauzCa3D8Gui.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gnosJeDIDQXy9uDewXphEpDWNYT.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Jack's lavish, fast-paced lifestyle changes one Christmas night when he stumbles into a grocery store holdup and disarms the gunman. The next morning he wakes up in bed lying next to Kate, his college sweetheart he left in order to pursue his career, and to the horrifying discovery that his former life no longer exists. As he stumbles through this alternate suburban universe, Jack finds himself at a crossroad where he must choose between his high-power career and the woman he loves.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":550205,\"title\":\"Wish Dragon\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lnPf6hzANL6pVQTxUlsNYSuhT5l.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4kIRrW1AlHP5Idne8CPHeQt8nR5.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Determined teen Din is longing to reconnect with his childhood best friend when he meets a wish-granting dragon who shows him the magic of possibilities.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11451,\"title\":\"Herbie Fully Loaded\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7lTfTZ8CDfXw09eAv3OOvsbCVgs.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u6qrMY2PIzXwmydmKNHmVDFbjaV.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Maggie Peyton, the new owner of Number 53 - the free-wheelin' Volkswagen bug with a mind of its own - puts the car through its paces on the road to becoming a NASCAR competitor.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1243341,\"title\":\"Z-O-M-B-I-E-S 4: Dawn of the Vampires\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6rGsqBxI4r1YkS9FuraovWi465w.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/68TGPnvmZ21NBOoV5IUZ4fQDyvZ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A new adventure dawns for Zed and Addison when their summer road trip takes an unexpected detour, landing them in the middle of yet another monster rivalry: Daywalkers vs. Vampires. Tensions flare when Zed and Addison find themselves acting as camp counselors between the two opposing supernatural factions. With the help of Eliza and Willa, they must convince sworn enemies Nova and Victor to try to unite their warring worlds before an even greater threat endangers them all.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9007,\"title\":\"Just Like Heaven\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2cLbyVNhEEaUJGg7rfbLtX6454I.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k63j5qexRlpD3wxzETKfuZRVWiT.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Shortly after David Abbott moves into his new San Francisco digs, he has an unwelcome visitor on his hands: winsome Elizabeth Masterson, who asserts that the apartment is hers -- and promptly vanishes. When she starts appearing and disappearing at will, David thinks she's a ghost, while Elizabeth is convinced she's alive.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romance\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"kA9NfV4pM_Q\",\"name\":\"Final Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"UVAki9SGrlg\",\"name\":\"Official UK Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"HP0BWBWn14I\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}